{"id": 60, "name": "Hanabi", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/9/95/Hero601-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021142105", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Damage"], "difficulty": "10", "stats": ["20", "70", "80", "10"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "Leader of the Scarlet Sect, in the Scarlet Shadow of the Cadia Riverlands.", "skills": [{"name": "Ninjutsu: Petal Barrage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_062555a0aac422ba461293262f8092e0.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Hanabi's Basic Attacks and skills will launch Petal Blades after hitting a target, dealing 30% damage, and bouncing up to 4 times to nearby enemies. Bounces from her Basic Attacks inherit her Attack Effects."}, {"name": "Ninjutsu: Equinox", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6a2d89d1131e3a9a8f7df3b3fc9503c2.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 52, "tagname": "Shield", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 15   Mana Cost: 75", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: Whenever Hanabi has a shield from any source, she is immune to control effects.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Hanabi gains a 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> shield for 5s. When the shield is active, she gains 20% Movement Speed and 25% Attack Speed, and 20% of her damage dealt to enemy heroes is added to this shield (only 10% of the damage dealt to non-hero units is added). This shield cannot exceed 50% of her Max HP."}, {"name": "Ninjutsu: Soul Scroll", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9cf15eea1a094676d6b4dafd87bc2adf.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Hanabi fires the energy Kunai in the targeted direction, dealing 350<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies along the way and reducing their Movement Speed by 60% for 1s. Enemy units hit will also be marked, allowing Hanabi's next Bounce Damage from Basic Attacks to deal 30<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> on them with no damage decay."}, {"name": "Forbidden Jutsu: Higanbana", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_7d52b73b23ce9feabf62c1dd40fce331.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 40   Mana Cost: 120", "desc": "Hanabi throws Higanbana in the targeted direction, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the first enemy hero hit and immobilizing them for 0.8s. After 1s, Higanbana will bloom at the location of the first hit, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to nearby enemies. Subsequent hits on the same target decay to 30% damage."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Haas' Claws", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_139190ae1087ea51233fdbefb1bbbf5b.png"}, {"name": "Windtalker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9c06b97bb75d8a81e28a87df1ab92193.png"}, {"name": "Sea Halberd", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d78fb27df8def66bd1460e851bfbf7a9.png"}, {"name": "Berserker's Fury", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_020f531307fa505083b791e6f3093eb4.png"}, {"name": "Blade of Despair", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f9fa31f80ff